configurable-tab-strip

From: Victor Araújo <victor@victor-software-house.com>

Downstream-Reason: Make desktop tab strip sizing, spacing, controls, and status reservation fully configurable.
Upstream-Status: not-submitted
Drop-When: Upstream exposes equivalent validated tab-strip geometry and chrome configuration.
